    58	The filing also put two public signals before Cooper. Trump had told reporters that without recognition the building would close and end up being ripped down. The filing included a photograph of him reading a placard that appeared to say “Kennedy Center DEMOLISHED.” A Kennedy Center spokesperson separately said that nothing was being demolished.
    59	3
