   166	What we do not know yet
   167	Whether the September 23 status report was filed, and whether the initial safety closure was extended. Searched: the admitted docket material and coverage through September 19; the report was not yet due.
   168	Whether the defendants have developed a project-scope change that would trigger the notice order. Searched: the admitted board records, plans, filings and coverage; none contains an identified demolition plan.
