on in the related Beatty case, the Court has preliminarily enjoined the Board from effectuating its March 16 vote to close the Center. So the League’s argument would seem to have been overtaken by events. In any case, it is far from clear that Section 76j(a)(1)(G), by its own terms at least, precludes a closure necessary to effectuate essential building repairs. 24 
