nt_ss_a_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_share_email /></svg></a><button class="gnt_ss_a gnt_ss_a__sa" data-ss-a=s data-t-l=:h|v|c|shareapi aria-label="Share natively" data-g-r=base_si><svg class=gnt_ss_a_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_shareapi /></svg></button></div></div><div class=gnt_ar_b><aside aria-label=advertisement class="gnt_x__c gnt_x__lbl gnt_x__bv"><div data-g-r=lazy data-gl-method=llx id=~ad-slot-7103-usatoday-banner_videoplayer-news-politics-2-ac1 class="gnt_x_sl gnt_x_bv"></div></aside><aside aria-label=advertisement class="gnt_x__c gnt_x__bvd gnt_x__h"><div id=ad-slot-7103-usatoday-banner_videoplayer-dk-news-politics-3-ac1 class="gnt_x_sl gnt_x_bvd"></div></aside><aside class="gnt_em gnt_em__fp gnt_em_vp__tp gnt_em__el" aria-label="Video - Trump says Kennedy Center could be 'ripped down' without his support"><div class=gnt_em_vp_w data-g-r=vp_tp data-c-vt=exco data-c-vpa="pl=teal-hero&nm=1&exv=article_hero&de&plcmt=2&cc=news/politics/1&iu=/7103/usatoday/preroll_video/&cut" data-c-vpd="{&#34;adsEnabled&#34;:true,&#34;awsPath&#34;:&#34;news/politics&#34;,&#34;byline&#34;:&#34;Connor Ling&#34;,&#34;cd&#34;:1789601735671,&#34;credit&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;length&#34;:32,&#34;headline&#34;:&#34;Trump says Kennedy Center could be 'ripped down' without his support&#34;,&#34;hlsURL&#34;:&#34;https://hlsmedia.gannett-cdn.com/authoring/videos/presto/renditions/91801034007/93add872-6abe-449d-805a-6028d45d7e6a/480p_30fps,720p_30fps,1080p_30fps,master.m3u8?subtitles=91801034007&#34;,&#34;id&#34;:&#34;91801034007&#34;,&#34;keywords&#34;:&#34;Vertical Video,VPC - Video Analytics,Politics,Executive Branch,Donald Trump,Overall Negative&#34;,&#34;mp4URL&#34;:&#34;https://www.gannett-cdn.com/authoring/videos/presto/renditions/91801034007/93add872-6abe-449d-805a-6028d45d7e6a/1080p_30fps.mp4&#34;,&#34;origin&#34;:&#34;Reuters&#34;,&#34;pageURL&#34;:{&#34;long&#34;:&#34;https://www.usatoday.com/videos/news/politics/2026/09/16/trump-says-kennedy-center-could-be-ripped-down-if-demands-not-met/91801034007/&#34;},&#34;promoBrief&#34;:&#34;President Trump said the Kennedy Center could be torn down without the support of his administration.&#34;,&#34;propertyName&#34;:&#34;USATODAY&#34;,&#34;series&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;ssts&#34;:{&#34;section&#34;:&#34;news&#34;,&#34;subsection&#34;:&#34;politics&#34;,&#34;topic&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;subtopic&#34;:&#34;&#34;},&#34;title&#34;:&#34;Trump says Kennedy Center could be ‘ripped down’ if demands not met&#34;,&#34;tna&#34;:[&#34;Vertical Video&#34;,&#34;VPC - Video Analytics&#34;,&#34;Politics&#34;,&#34;Executive Branch&#34;,&#34;Donald Trump&#34;,&#34;Overall Negative&#34;],&#34;videoStill&#34;:&#34;https://www.gannett-cdn.com/authoring/authoring-images/2026/09/16/USAT/91800936007-trump-kenney-center-mp-400-01-02-16-still-001.png?crop=607,1079,x576,y0&#34;}"><div class=gnt_em_vp_c><button class=gnt_em_vp_db aria-label="Close docked video player"><svg class=gnt_em_vp_db_svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M9 7.625L13.125 3.5 14.5 4.875 10.375 9l4.125 4.125-1.375 1.375L9 10.375 4.875 14.5 3.5 13.125 7.625 9 3.5 4.875 4.875 3.5 9 7.625z"/></svg></button><div class=gnt_em_vp_c_pl__ec><div id=gnt_xp__1 class=pbs><div class=pbs__player><div class=pb-stream><div class=__exco_root_container><div class=__exco_content_container><video class=__exco_content_video poster="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/09/17/USAT/91802572007-20260916-t-224957-z-1146010495-rc-2-mkna-3-lmf-0-rtrmadp-3-usafedtrump.JPG?crop=2513,1414,x0,y0&width=660&height=371&format=pjpg&auto=webp" muted playsinline elementtiming=ar-lead-video-exco data-g-r="vp_ap vp_tg" disablepictureinpicture></video></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=gnt_em_vh data-c-et="Trump says Kennedy Center could be 'ripped down' without his support"></div><div class="gnt_em_vb gnt_em_vb__he" aria-label="President Trump said the Kennedy Center could be torn down without the support of his administration."></div></aside><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>WASHINGTON — <a href=/news/politics/donald-trump/ data-t-l=:b|e|k|⚑u class=gnt_ar_b_a>President Donald Trump</a> said the John F. Kennedy Center for the Performing Arts will "end up being ripped down" without renovations that he's threatened not to carry out unless his name is added to the side of the building.</p><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>Trump, speaking to reporters on Sept. 16, defended his position that he be recognized with an honorary inscription below the main sign of the Kennedy Center ‒ a move the center's board approved but <a href=/story/news/politics/2026/09/15/judge-blocks-kennedy-center-trump-name-inscription-sign/91775374007/ data-t-l=:b|e|k|⚑u class=gnt_ar_b_a>a federal judge this week blocked</a>.</p><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>"I think that the Trump administration should certainly have recognition," Trump said. "Because, frankly, if we don't do that, it's going to close. It'll end up being ripped down. It's in very, very bad, bad shape, very dangerous shape."</p><aside class=gnt_ar_b_sp>Trump's second term: <a href=/story/news/politics/2026/09/16/trump-kennedy-center-name-reaction/91789640007/ rel="noreferrer noopener" target=_blank data-t-l=":b|e|spike click:4|⚑u" class=gnt_ar_b_sp_a>President Trump threw 'tantrum' during Kennedy Center meeting, congresswoman says</a></aside><a class="gnt_em gnt_em_gl gnt_em__el" href=/picture-gallery/news/politics/2025/01/20/donald-trumps-47th-presidency-in-pictures/77839237007/ data-t-l="⚑g:l|l|c|view gallery:inline promo" aria-label="View Gallery - Donald Trump's second term: Actions, travels of the 47th president" target=_blank><img class=gnt_em_gl_i data-g-r=lazy data-gl-src="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/09/13/USAT/91745911007-gty-2294567692.jpg?crop=5192,2922,x3,y19&width=660&height=372&format=pjpg&auto=webp" data-gl-srcset="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/09/13/USAT/91745911007-gty-2294567692.jpg?crop=5192,2922,x3,y19&width=1320&height=744&format=pjpg&auto=webp 2x" decoding=async alt="" width=660 height=372 /><svg class=gnt_em_gl_i_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_camera /></svg><div class=gnt_em_gl_vg data-c-tc=105><svg class=gnt_em_gl_vg_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_rightArrow /></svg></div><div class="gnt_em_t gnt_em_t__hb" data-c-et="Donald Trump's second term: Actions, travels of the 47th president" aria-label="Donald Trump is the 47th president of the United States and the second president to serve non-consecutive terms."></div></a><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>The Kennedy Center's board, composed of mostly Trump loyalists with the president serving as chairman, <a href=/story/news/politics/2026/09/15/kennedy-center-votes-to-immediately-close-trump-renovations/91778454007/ data-t-l=:b|e|k|⚑u class=gnt_ar_b_a>voted on Sept. 15 to close the iconic institution</a> immediately to undergo two-year renovations that Trump has vowed to help pay for.</p><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>Trump and Kennedy Center officials have argued the center's disrepair after years of neglect has<a href=/story/news/politics/2026/08/25/trump-kennedy-center-cannot-be-saved-without-his-name/91462772007/ data-t-l=:b|e|k|⚑u class=gnt_ar_b_a> turned into a safety threat to guests attending shows</a>. Congress has approved $257 million for renovations. But the Justice Department says without Trump’s additional fundraising aiming for more than $100 million, the work can’t be completed.</p><aside aria-label=advertisement class="gnt_x__c gnt_x__lbl gnt_x__al"><div data-g-r=lazy data-gl-method=llx id=~ad-slot-7103-usatoday-native-article_link-news-politics-4-ac1 class="gnt_x_sl gnt_x_al"></div></aside><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>"It's been badly maintained for 25 years," Trump said. "I'd like to be able to save but it's going to take a lot of subsidy into the future, and for us as an administration to want to do that, I think the Trump administration should be recognized."</p><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>After the board's vote to close the center, <a href=/story/news/politics/2026/09/15/kennedy-center-votes-to-immediately-close-trump-renovations/91778454007/ data-t-l=:b|e|k|⚑u class=gnt_ar_b_a>Trump warned he won't pursue the renovations</a> unless U.S. District Judge Christopher Cooper's decision keeping his name off the center's building is overturned on appeal.</p><aside class=gnt_ar_b_sp>Trump and the Kennedy Center. <a href=/story/news/politics/2026/09/15/judge-blocks-kennedy-center-trump-name-inscription-sign/91775374007/ rel="noreferrer noopener" target=_blank data-t-l=":b|e|spike click:11|⚑u" class=gnt_ar_b_sp_a>Judge blocks Kennedy Center's plan to add Trump's name back on building</a></aside><a class="gnt_em gnt_em_gl gnt_em__el" href=/picture-gallery/news/politics/2026/09/16/kennedy-center-interior-photo/91793717007/ data-t-l="⚑g:l|l|c|view gallery:inline promo" aria-label="View Gallery - Inside the Kennedy Center amid Trump's push to have name inscribed" target=_blank><img class=gnt_em_gl_i data-g-r=lazy data-gl-src="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/09/16/USAT/91793951007-getty-images-2294942611.jpg?crop=5451,3066,x0,y284&width=660&height=372&format=pjpg&auto=webp" data-gl-srcset="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/09/16/USAT/91793951007-getty-images-2294942611.jpg?crop=5451,3066,x0,y284&width=1320&height=744&format=pjpg&auto=webp 2x" decoding=async alt="" width=660 height=372 /><svg class=gnt_em_gl_i_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_camera /></svg><div class=gnt_em_gl_vg data-c-tc=18><svg class=gnt_em_gl_vg_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_rightArrow /></svg></div><div class="gnt_em_t gnt_em_t__hb" data-c-et="Inside the Kennedy Center amid Trump's push to have name inscribed" aria-label="Photos take a look inside the John F. Kennedy Center for the Performing Arts amid President Trump's fight to have his name on its facade."></div></a><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>Cooper ruled the Kennedy Center's plan to add an inscription on the building that says "renovated and restored by Donald J. Trump" cannot move forward. The judge said the inscription violates his previous order in May to remove Trump's name from the center's title and signage and violates the 1964 law that created the center to honor President Kennedy after his assassination.</p><aside aria-label=advertisement class="gnt_x__c gnt_x__lbl gnt_x__al"><div data-g-r=lazy data-gl-method=llx id=~ad-slot-7103-usatoday-native-article_link-news-politics-5-ac2 data-x-c=2 class="gnt_x_sl gnt_x_al"></div></aside><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>The Justice Department has appealed the decision on Trump's honorary inscription.</p><p class=gnt_ar_b_p>Cooper is expected to later rule whether the temporarily closure of the Kennedy Center also violates his previous order. The judge, in the same May order, blocked the Kennedy Center board's vote in March to close for two years, citing a lack of adequate information before the rushed action.</p><aside class="gnt_em gnt_em_anc" id=gnt_atomsnc data-g-r=lazy data-gl-method=loadAnc aria-label="Newsletter signup form"></aside><p class=gnt_ar_b_p><em>Reach Joey Garrison on X @joeygarrison.</em></p></div><div class=gnt_ss data-g-r=base_sc data-ss-u=https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/2026/09/16/trump-kennedy-center-ripped-down-renovations/91802015007/ data-ss-t="Trump says Kennedy Center could be 'ripped down' without his overhaul" data-ss-d="President Trump said the Kennedy Center will &#34;end up being ripped down&#34; without renovations he's threatened to spike unless he's given &#34;recognition.&#34;"><a class=gnt_ss_a data-ss-a=f data-t-l=:i|v|c|facebook aria-label="Share to Facebook" rel=noreferrer data-g-r=base_si href="https://www.facebook.com/dialog/share?display=popup&app_id=1279862243338849&href=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.usatoday.com%2Fstory%2Fnews%2Fpolitics%2F2026%2F09%2F16%2Ftrump-kennedy-center-ripped-down-renovations%2F91802015007%2F"><svg class=gnt_ss_a_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_share_facebook /></svg></a><a class=gnt_ss_a data-ss-a=t data-t-l=:i|v|c|twitter aria-label="Share to Twitter" rel=noreferrer data-g-r=base_si href="https://x.com/intent/post?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.usatoday.com%2Fstory%2Fnews%2Fpolitics%2F2026%2F09%2F16%2Ftrump-kennedy-center-ripped-down-renovations%2F91802015007%2F&text=Trump%20says%20Kennedy%20Center%20could%20be%20'ripped%20down'%20without%20his%20overhaul&via=usatoday"><svg class=gnt_ss_a_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_share_twitter /></svg></a><a class=gnt_ss_a data-t-l=:i|v|c|email aria-label="Share by email" href="mailto:?subject=Trump%20says%20Kennedy%20Center%20could%20be%20'ripped%20down'%20without%20his%20overhaul%20-%20from%20USA%20TODAY&body=Trump%20says%20Kennedy%20Center%20could%20be%20'ripped%20down'%20without%20his%20overhaul%0A%0APresident%20Trump%20said%20the%20Kennedy%20Center%20will%20%22end%20up%20being%20ripped%20down%22%20without%20renovations%20he's%20threatened%20to%20spike%20unless%20he's%20given%20%22recognition.%22%0A%0ACheck%20out%20this%20story%20on%20usatoday.com%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.usatoday.com%2Fstory%2Fnews%2Fpolitics%2F2026%2F09%2F16%2Ftrump-kennedy-center-ripped-down-renovations%2F91802015007%2F"><svg class=gnt_ss_a_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_share_email /></svg></a><button class="gnt_ss_a gnt_ss_a__sa" data-ss-a=s data-t-l=:i|v|c|shareapi aria-label="Share natively" data-g-r=base_si><svg class=gnt_ss_a_svg><use xlink:href=#gnt_svg_shareapi /></svg></button></div><div class="gnt_tb gnt_tbb" data-g-r=lazy data-gl-method=llx><div id=gnt_tbw_1></div></div><div data-g-r=lazy data-gl-method=flp class=gnt_flp><div class="gnt_m_dl flipp-ux-header gnt_flp_t" aria-label="Featured Weekly Ad">Featured Weekly Ad</div></div></article><div class=gnt_rr><div class="gnt_x__c gnt_rr_xpst"><aside aria-label=advertisement class="gnt_x__lbl gnt_x__pf"><div id=ad-slot-7103-usatoday-poster-news-politics-6-ac1 class="gnt_x_sl gnt_x_p"></div></aside></div><form class="gnt_m gnt_m_nls" data-g-r=base_sp onmousedown=event.stopPropagation() onmouseup=event.stopPropagation() onsubmit="g$.el.nfsh(event, this)" data-c-nlsbc=8872UT-E-NLETTER02 data-c-nlt="Daily Briefing, in your inbox" data-c-nlsd="Start y