both an unparalleled fundraiser and world-class developer, and it is due to President Trump’s
position as the head of the Center that both financial backers and Congress have been willing to,
and remain willing to, support the Center to prevent financial ruin;
IT IS HEREBY RESOLVED that the Center desires to recognize and honor President Trump’s
current and future existential and unprecedented contributions to the survival of the Center by all
legal means, in any or all of the following ways:
FIRST, the Center desires to honor the President’s contributions, current and future, with an
