    49	   Beatty asked for an emergency hearing after the main building closed and after the board voted to close it for renovation. The defendants answered that the immediate
    50	   closure was separate from the renovation decision, while Floca described it as a temporary safety measure. Executive Director Matt Floca declared that structural
    51	   deterioration created acute risks to public safety and that the initial closure would last seven days unless extended.^[28]1^[29]4^[30]5
