-state-slot="slot-106afc94-7212-41ea-8fad-b160b224df14"><h3>Number in the more-than-30-days notice requirement</h3><strong class="ledger-value" data-state-figure="story-figure:ac13c39c1564750fcd0e38770fb3616169a32b95e0a8e37499ddbb7dcca276d1" data-state-figure-role="current" data-figure-value="30" data-figure-unit="days">30 days</strong><a class="ledger-source" href="/records/upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/" data-passage="more than 30 days before the implementation" aria-label="Read the source for Number in the more-than-30-days notice requirement">UPI <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="ledger-source-passage"><summary>Recorded passage</summary><blockquote data-source-copy>more than 30 days before the implementation</blockquote></details></article><article class="ledger-row" data-state-slot="slot-b105d119-6be2-42e2-b25c-8b9bc654574d"><h3>Votes in favor of the August closure resolution</h3><strong class="ledger-value" data-state-figure="story-figure:6d43ab5c88e2f31c776ae08be3143e7deb8c01414b0e7dd8808975f91760b897" data-state-figure-role="current" data-figure-value="23" data-figure-unit="votes in favor">23 votes in favor</strong><a class="ledger-source" href="/records/board-minutes-68-3-2026-08-13/" data-passage="23 in favor, 3 opposed" aria-label="Read the source for Votes in favor of the August closure resolution">Kennedy Center Board of Trustees <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="ledger-source-passage"><summary>Recorded passage</summary><blockquote data-source-copy>23 in favor, 3 opposed</blockquote></details></article></details><section class="revision-timeline" data-layer="fact" data-revision-confirmations="0" data-revision-changes="0"></section><section data-layer="proof"><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href="/records/board-minutes-68-3-2026-08-13/" data-source-copy>Kennedy Center Board of Trustees</a> · August 13, 2026 · <span data-source-copy>Kennedy Center board meeting minutes</span></li><li><a href="/records/upi-kennedy-center-20