   On September 18, the defendants filed a motion to dissolve the May
   preliminary injunction and a renewed motion for partial summary
   judgment on Beatty's remaining closure and construction claims. Those
   motions asked the court for relief; they did not themselves dissolve
   the injunction or decide the claims.^24^25

